No, it was a gift from Nami.

106
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,037
What do you want with it?

107
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:23,885
If you let me have the armlet,
I'll tell you how to get to this.

108
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,440
That a promise? Sure.

109
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,191
Just fork it over, kiddo.

110
