Okay, you got a deal.

111
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,320
All right!

112
00:06:32,420 --> 00:06:34,538
First off, let's shake those guards.

113
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:36,297
Grab onto my feet, okay?

114
00:06:36,380 --> 00:06:37,210
Your feet.

115
00:06:37,740 --> 00:06:39,240
Good, now start running!

116
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:41,060
Be careful with those!

117
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,631
