The idiot didn't even hear me.

192
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:16,120
I'm lucky he's so stupid. That's awesome.

193
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,637
This is a treasure map?

194
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,955
I didn't have a clue.

195
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:21,160
Bet that'll be really fun. Huh.

196
00:10:25,180 --> 00:10:27,917
Sorry, kid, but if you know the
truth, I'll have to kill you.

197
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:30,824
You better take this now
in case I forget later!

198
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:35,677
You know that's a treasure map, and
you're still gonna give it to me?

199
00:10:35,760 --> 00:10:36,701
Yeah, of course,

200
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:40,577
treasure's cool and all, but Ace is more
important But if you give it to me now,

201
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:44,037
what's to stop me from running off with
it and leaving you down here to die?

202
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:46,757
Nothing, I guess, but you
gave your word you'd help out,

203
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,546
and that's good enough for me

204
00:10:49,060 --> 00:10:49,917
Ha ha!

205
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:53,680
Those drastic eyes pouring into my soul!

206
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:57,400
Hermit Skelgril's straw
hat, can't you see?

207
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:59,080
Don't do it!

208
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:01,060
You deserve better than this!

209
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:03,180
I'm no good for you!

210
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:08,220
After all this time,

211
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:12,558
I finally have the key to Captain
John's secret, and I own all to you!

212
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:13,750
Thanks, buddy.

213
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:15,440
You're a real champ!

214
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:21,540
Now how do I ditch you and
get the hell out of here?

215
00:11:26,940 --> 00:11:29,777
Oh, if we break through the walls
here, is it like a shortcut?

216
00:11:29,860 --> 00:11:30,690
I can do that!

217
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,414
What's wrong with you?

218
00:11:43,860 --> 00:11:45,677
What the hell is going on in here?

219
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:48,037
That clown is bugging
the escaped prisoner.

220
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:49,649
But who is that other guy?

221
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:51,800
Oh, no, this is the guard room.

222
00:11:51,980 --> 00:11:54,451
If we keep going this way, I'm in trouble.

223
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:56,560
For crap's sake, please stop!

224
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:05,640
This place is crazy.

225
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:08,394
I mean, there's a forest in the prison?

226
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:13,900
And why is everything all red?

227
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:16,285
Who are those guys down there?

228
00:12:16,660 --> 00:12:18,189
They're prisoners, stupid.

229
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:20,889
This so-called forest
is a torture chamber.

230
00:12:21,380 --> 00:12:23,380
Every leaf is as sharp as a razor.

231
00:12:23,540 --> 00:12:25,775
That's why they call them blade trees.

232
00:12:26,260 --> 00:12:29,657
And the grass is made of spikes
that creak you like needles.

233
00:12:29,740 --> 00:12:31,564
It's called spike needle grass.

234
00:12:31,740 --> 00:12:32,740
Original, I know.

235
00:12:33,180 --> 00:12:35,857
The jailers release
venomous spiders and chase

236
00:12:35,940 --> 00:12:38,797
the prisoners up and down
the forest all day long.

237
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:42,177
Deadly pitchforks behind them,
piercing needles beneath them?

238
00:12:42,260 --> 00:12:44,420
and cutting razors everywhere else.

239
00:12:44,660 --> 00:12:46,737
They run until they're
drenched in their own blood,

240
00:12:46,820 --> 00:12:49,197
suffering agonies they
never thought possible.

241
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:54,680
This is level one, otherwise known as the
Crimson Hell, the true face of Impel Down.

242
00:12:54,900 --> 00:12:56,820
Haven't I suffered enough?

243
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:59,420
You're gonna kill me.

244
00:13:00,180 --> 00:13:02,440
Wow, this place really is like hell.

245
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:04,737
Are they doing this kind
of stuff to Ace, too?

246
00:13:04,820 --> 00:13:06,055
Don't think about it.

247
00:13:06,180 --> 00:13:08,240
Just keep falling. That's dumb.

248
00:13:08,580 --> 00:13:09,639
I'm gonna get cut.

249
00:13:10,420 --> 00:13:11,250
Oh, yeah.

250
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:13,600
Watch this!

251
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,280
Listen up, kid.

252
